9.
Officers of the University.
- The following shall be the officers of the University namely;
(i)
The Chancellor;
(ii)
The Vice-Chancellor;
(iii)
The Registrar;
(iv)
The Comptroller;
(v)
The Dean of Student Affairs;
(vi)
